ChunkSeal is a chunked authenticated encryption container. Its format
identifier is CSEA.

Project code and documentation are licensed under version 3 of the GNU
Affero General Public License. The complete license is in LICENSE.

Python uses the external cryptography package and Java uses the JDK's
cryptographic providers. These dependencies retain their own licenses;
their source and binaries are not bundled in this repository.
